# Optional. Copy to .env (gitignored) for the dashboard server's local
# settings; without it the server runs as usual. The server reads .env when
# it starts, and a variable already set in your shell wins. The CLI script
# (npm run cli-view) doesn't read it.

# Custom insights hook (README: "Custom insights hook"). Relative paths are
# from this folder; a Git Bash path (/d/hooks/insights.sh) works too.
# VIEW_PRS_INSIGHTS_HOOK_SCRIPT=local-hooks/insights.sh
# VIEW_PRS_INSIGHTS_HOOK_TIMEOUT_MS=10000
